<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney ups Stratus.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney ups Stratus.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Shao Wang raised Stratus Computer Inc to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
